{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/4/desc","kr_sha":"43da8f2faf5af065a534f87945d13e2671f10c1f1b86cbf5539f9d5668181a0f","zh":"對話 1","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/4/dlg","kr_sha":"9a5f09d2c845c598a4f995919e9c425d8cad890c5b8e0a3e628cb626993b2585","zh":"此乃……蜘蛛們的居所。因此必然……<color=#50acff><size=60%><i>（嗶嗶聲）</i></size></color>獵物自然會蜂擁而來。不必離開巢穴，也無需挨餓一日。\n對我而言，是否存在理由……需要離開如此便利的生活呢。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/4/id","kr_sha":"28b1c9e0344a6f6473036b30c44fe20e01162c518d287ea8aaadb6fbfb7e1798","zh":"smalltalk_10115_1","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/5/desc","kr_sha":"ae22d4fc09a33be838e1721a7aa26d5dbd2dd2aab86575413ab771d478069747","zh":"對話 2","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/5/dlg","kr_sha":"aed128b2a2a46a66aa06de5dee3d114e1fb118ddcc4a788e779103604c71c9af","zh":"那孩子啊。嗯……那孩子天賦異稟。尤其對時間的感知與適性相當優越。我們將插著螺旋的小猿放入時間金庫，女兒完成所有作業歸來之時……當再次取出小猿並拔起插著的螺旋，她曾展現的目光仍深深烙印於我心裡。接著竟於任何父輩皆未察覺時，進出時間金庫並加以利用……你不認為她相當聰穎嗎？可惜，她只不過是個聰明的「孩子」而已……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/5/id","kr_sha":"0cdad60f7760ec38975d6faa61ebef249fe7205929c18e94600d404e74fab5dc","zh":"smalltalk_10115_2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/6/desc","kr_sha":"65e016ef58165be68acb39554fb899828842c8c1029509638e067da9d0efde1f","zh":"對話 3","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/6/dlg","kr_sha":"a254ad54fab6ae8435e449fc6687d403ba0e06aa10995bc58a0b9752d23c38bf","zh":"我的人生……如同螺旋般。無論何時都向著終點前行，然而速度愈漸趨緩，最後必定無法抵達終點……女兒亦然。粉碎機，或是焚化爐……又或者是奈落深處的蜘蛛絲。為了創造那些事物，我將女兒立於螺旋之上，也將我的人生置於上頭。遠遠一看……那些排列糾纏的模樣與螺旋並無不同，恐怕不會再有如此完好的證據了吧。<color=#50acff><size=60%><i>（嗶嗶聲）</i></size></color>來，聽見了吧。這份「愉快」不知何時結束。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/6/id","kr_sha":"c50790a96bbf7b50b8d27503532ad832b4cb2dd7560b42d55df3acb7455eebcd","zh":"smalltalk_10115_3","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/7/desc","kr_sha":"e5d82a8beeb0245da4845fe51a4668374a236c0f0c6717796be8507a51eef742","zh":"同步後對話 1","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Yisang_KumoIndex_10115.json|/dataList/7/dlg","kr_sha":"1650debc6ada554dbaa06c5dbeba24572b8c491e1ee41e0fedb2250d7498e066","zh":"那麼，這次呢。<color=#50acff><size=60%><i>（嗶嗶聲）</i></size></color>是變種劍啊。嗯，然後接著是……<color=#50acff><size=60%><i>（嗶嗶聲）</i></size></color>大鐮。今天也再次展現如指令般……崇高的武器鑑識之目啊。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
